230	    /** Move a claim to a new status; a change its status does not allow, or one the sheet's
231	     *  permission matrix does not let the user's role make, is refused, as is the user who opened a
232	     *  claim settling it. A clerk settling a claim whose due is above the clerk limit
233	     *  leaves it PENDING a steward's approval instead. */
234	    @Transactional
