495	     *  have today as an OPEN claim bound by no statement (today's rates, grades, floor and late
496	     *  charge), and its status log gains a SETTLED line. Anyone else, a claim that is not SETTLED, or
497	     *  one dated in a closed period, is refused. */
498	    @Transactional
